{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6cc71356-a096-88d7-9573-8abda811802e",
  "created_at": "2026-02-12T10:29:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ana Vieira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:27:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City of Newport Finance Department, this is Janet Whitcomb. How may I direct your call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:27:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, thank you. My name is Ana Vieira. I manage a property at 3 Kay Street, up on the Hill. I got the tax bill and it went up. I want to know why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:27:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. Three Kay Street, correct? Let me bring up the account. One moment, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:27:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, 3 Kay Street. Thank you, I wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:27:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you for holding. I see the bill. In general, a bill can change because the assessed value changed, or because the tax rate changed, or both. Do you have the assessed value from your last bill in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:28:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, assessed value. Yes, I have both bills here. The old one, and the new one. The new one is higher, so the value is higher, you are saying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:28:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm saying that is the usual cause. Assessed values are set by the Assessor's office, so for the reasoning behind the number, they would be the ones to explain it. I can transfer you if you like."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:28:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, maybe after. First, I want to ask, is there an exemption I can apply for? What is the form number, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:28:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exemptions depend on the type, such as elderly, veteran, or disability. Which one were you asking about? And is the property owner-occupied?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:28:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, I see. I am only the manager, the owner is not me. So I will ask the owner what kind. But the form number, you have it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:28:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The form differs by exemption type, so I can't give you a single number. The Assessor's office can tell you the exact form once you know which one applies. Shall I transfer you there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:28:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, transfer. One moment, I write this down. Assessor, then ask which exemption, then the form. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:29:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:29:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, I am busy today, I also write questions for the trivia night I run at a pub, so my papers are everywhere. Anyway, thank you very much, Miss Whitcomb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:29:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Vieira. Transferring you now. Please hold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-12T10:29:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, thank you."
    }
  ],
